  "threshold_source": "Default 3% for E2E time; no matching E2E A/A. Must calibrate A/A before declaring regression.",
  "memory_scope": "Stage1 pipeline forward peaks measured separately. Each window synchronizes and resets allocator peaks before the call, captures peaks before every nested reset, and reads after final device synchronization. Stage0 text and VAE windows use the same boundary. Two-stage bound sums per-process Stage0 and Stage1 request peaks on each logical card, then takes the largest card. This is a conservative allocator bound, not a simultaneous device HBM peak. Initialization, driver memory and uninstrumented allocations are excluded. The 1% bound check is conservative supporting evidence, not a measured device-HBM gate."
